{"about_the_game":"Aura Wallpaper enables animated desktop &amp;&amp; lockscreen wallpapers on Windows 10 and 11.<br>It enables the display of any HTML page, for example Websites or YouTube videos on your Windows desktop or lockscreen.<br><br><strong><u>How to use Aura:</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Start Aura and right click the Aura logo in your task bar<br></li><li> Click on <strong>Select Wallpaper</strong><br></li><li> Browse for your favorite video<br></li><li> Fast forward to the point you want your wallpaper to start<br></li><li> Click <strong>Set LockScreen Wallpaper</strong><br></li><li> The video is now your lockscreen wallpaper starting at the same timepoint</li></ul><br>Performance and resource usage is optimized: For lockscreen wallpapers Aura Wallpaper will not consume any resources unless your PC is locked.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2726120?t=1734611566","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2726120?t=1734611566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726120/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1734611566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726120/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1734611566","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Aura Wallpaper enables animated desktop &amp;&amp; lockscreen wallpapers on Windows 10 and 11.<br>It enables the display of any HTML page, for example Websites or YouTube videos on your Windows desktop or lockscreen.<br><br><strong><u>How to use Aura:</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Start Aura and right click the Aura logo in your task bar<br></li><li> Click on <strong>Select Wallpaper</strong><br></li><li> Browse for your favorite video<br></li><li> Fast forward to the point you want your wallpaper to start<br></li><li> Click <strong>Set LockScreen Wallpaper</strong><br></li><li> The video is n